# First visit to the Underground, via the Explorer Kit on Y.
#
# Oreburgh is on the main matrix and not a bridge, so CanUseExplorerKit
# allows it. The kit is registered the way a rod is: Y is how a player
# uses it. The Roark intro flag is left clear on purpose; that is what
# makes CommManUnderground_InitUnderground set doNotConnectUnderground,
# which is the solo first-visit path.

name DIGGER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_EXPLORER_KIT 1
register-item ITEM_EXPLORER_KIT
flag FLAG_RECEIVED_EXPLORER_KIT
map MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY 0x12F 0x2F5 FACE_DOWN
